<title>USA: HMI Industries names Malone chairman.</title>
<headline>HMI Industries names Malone chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>HMI Industries Inc said it named James Malone chairman, replacing Kirk Foley, who remains president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The move is effective immediately, the company said.</p>
<p>Malone will help build the company's senior management team and implement its turnaround strategy, the company said.</p>
<p>Foley will still be responsible for the day-to-day operations of the company.</p>
</text>
